## Summary

- remove the desktop and mobile product screenshots from the README;
- replace the screenshot-heavy opening with a concise project positioning, capability matrix, and end-to-end flow;
- move Quick Start and architecture earlier so readers can understand and run the project faster;
- condense milestone details while retaining verified metrics, known gaps, data boundaries, and non-claims;
- update the verified frontend test count to 23 files / 81 tests.

## Impact

This is a documentation-only change. Runtime behavior, APIs, datasets, frozen evaluation results, and capability boundaries are unchanged.

## Validation

- all README relative links resolve;
- Markdown code fences are balanced;
- GitHub GFM render API succeeds;
- no project screenshot references remain in README;
- `git diff --check` passes;
- staged credential scan passes.
